## Contingency Notes

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| Steam screenshots path not found | Use `--path` CLI flag or Manage Sources UI to add manually |
| torchvision too large to install | Use `opencv-python-headless` backend instead |
| pHash collisions too high | Lower `PHASH_THRESHOLD` from 8 to 4 in `dedup.py` |
| Pillow not installed | EXIF falls back to OS stat; install `pip install Pillow` for full EXIF |
| DB grows very large (>1 GB) | Run `VACUUM` in SQLite; consider archiving old `ingestion_runs` rows |
| TempleConsole panel integration conflicts | Use `MissionControllerWidget` as a standalone `QDialog` instead |

